[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なかなか戻らないね……やっぱり探しに行こうかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's been gone a while... should we go look for her?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうでありますな。\n何か事故に巻き込まれているかもしれませぬ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps. She may have gotten caught up in something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なに言ってんのよ。そんなわけないじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, stop it. I'm fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ！\u3000大丈夫？\u3000心配してたんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna! Are you okay? We were worried about you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "悪かったわよ……突然飛び出していったりして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sorry. For running off like that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その……ごめんね。あの後鬼門とも話したんだ。\nヨハナが嫌なら、無理強いしちゃダメだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I'm sorry. I talked with Kimon after you left. We shouldn't push you into anything you don't want to do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、ヨハナはヨハナのやりたいように\nやるでござるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So do as you like! Whatever feels right to you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ？\u3000当たり前じゃない。\n私は私のやりたいようにやるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Obviously. I always do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイドル・ヨハナは、クールでありながら歌とダンスを\n完璧にこなす天才よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Idol Johanna is a genius—cool, flawless, perfect at singing and dancing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そして、たまに素が出ちゃって、\nそれを恥ずかしがる……そんな子なの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...And sometimes the real her slips out, and she gets embarrassed about it. That's who she is."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か、吹っ切れた様子ですな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You seem to have worked something out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……思い出しただけよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I just remembered something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイドルが立つステージは、アイドルの理想とファンの\n理想、両方があって成り立つものだということを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A stage only works when both the idol's ideal and the fans' ideal exist together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、私の理想を押し付けるだけじゃなくて、\nちゃんとファンの理想にも応えないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So I can't just push my own vision. I have to live up to what the fans want, too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰よりも私を推してくれてる、ファンのためにもね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Especially for the one who supports me more than anyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……何よ！\u3000なんか文句ある！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What?! You got a problem with that?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あるわけがないでございましょう。\n拙者だって、同じ思いでありまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all. I feel the very same way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシもアタシも！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me too, me too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん……それならいいのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph... then we're fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにね、ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, and Johanna—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシは、どっちのヨハナも大好きだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I love both sides of you, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "～～っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うるさいわね！\u3000あんたはそんなこと言ってる暇が\nあったらもっとダンスの練習しなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, be quiet! If you've got time to say stuff like that, use it to practice your dancing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "完璧になるまでみっちり付きっ切りで\n教えてあげるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm going to drill you until you're absolutely perfect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う……の、望むところだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... b-bring it on!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、一件落着、でありまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then. All's well that ends well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]